&INFO
Si8 diamond, LDA, 25 Ry, gamma, forces and stress
&END
&CPMD
 OPTIMIZE WAVEFUNCTION
 INITIALIZE WAVEFUNCTION ATOMS
 CONVERGENCE ORBITALS
  1.0d-12
 MAXSTEP
  20
 PRINT FORCES ON
 STRESS TENSOR
  1
&END
&DFT
 FUNCTIONAL LDA
&END
&SYSTEM
 SYMMETRY
  1
 CELL
  10.26 1.0 1.0 0.0 0.0 0.0
 CUTOFF
  25
&END
&ATOMS
*Si_SGS_LDA.psp
 LMAX=P
  8
  0.000000000  0.000000000  0.000000000
  5.130000000  5.130000000  0.000000000
  5.130000000  0.000000000  5.130000000
  0.000000000  5.130000000  5.130000000
  2.565000000  2.565000000  2.565000000
  7.695000000  7.695000000  2.565000000
  7.695000000  2.565000000  7.695000000
  2.565000000  7.695000000  7.695000000
&END
